    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/c4d0d9001320b7a1fffd135445e4aee5.avif?t=1752313381\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dracs After Dusk&quot; is an arcade, top-down shooter. Blast through bloodsuckers as the sharp shootin\u2019 sheriff of a wild west town. Duke it out with the deadliest bosses, claim their powerful weapons from the Armory and tasty food consumables from the Pantry to fuel your leaderboard topping run. Welcome to an old school quarter muncher but luckily you have unlimited credits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive waves of vampires\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/0366302d9b0adb220b2be65f6e366b5c.poster.avif?t=1752313381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/0366302d9b0adb220b2be65f6e366b5c.webm?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/0366302d9b0adb220b2be65f6e366b5c.mp4?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot down waves of enemy vampires using your trusty six-shooter revolver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dosido your way around tight quarters to avoid your last drop of blood being drained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build turrets to cover gaps in your reload time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duke it out with deadly bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/c3593f8d96309108873aab55a7535a1a.poster.avif?t=1752313381\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/c3593f8d96309108873aab55a7535a1a.webm?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/c3593f8d96309108873aab55a7535a1a.mp4?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging multiphase boss battles will test your resilience &amp; ability to execute under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss battles await you at the Armory, Diner, &amp; Casino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Big Baddie encounter features unique handcrafted playful pixel art animations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn upgraded items &amp; consumables\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/2a3f0a3d092ab1922f3b5f0bbb8b65a9.poster.avif?t=1752313381\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/2a3f0a3d092ab1922f3b5f0bbb8b65a9.webm?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/2a3f0a3d092ab1922f3b5f0bbb8b65a9.mp4?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Armory boss to claim new powerful weapons, such as the shotgun, sniper rifle, and SMG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your boss rush order to customize your upgrade path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop by the soul split shop to prevent 1 hit death.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/dd4d8f60136a93668cd48daca8bc5d90.poster.avif?t=1752313381\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/dd4d8f60136a93668cd48daca8bc5d90.webm?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745060/extras/dd4d8f60136a93668cd48daca8bc5d90.mp4?t=1752313381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden age arcade glory days to claim the ultimate reward of topping the leaderboard.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global leaderboard pits you against the world's sharpest shooters.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best in week leaderboard offers a fresh opportunity for ultimate bragging rights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
